WEBVTT

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:15.030
I just followed those two from
Berühren here, but ran into a nostalgic face.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:18.690
Long time no see, Kronen.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:24.570
We went through the same training
together once, with our hatred for Extendeds...

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:27.860
But here we are on completely different sides.

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:36.400
Is your car still the only thing in your heart?

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:40.940
My job is to eliminate all criminal Extendeds.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:44.320
I have nothing to say to a terrorist.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:52.530
But... Well, you're a different story.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:56.650
I have to take responsibility for
an embarrassing fellow pupil.

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:36.530
Imprisoning
Binds

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:02.480
You better close the distance
if you plan to take me down.

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:05.650
I have the advantage at this distance.

00:03:07.190 --> 00:03:10.940
You've only focused on
slaughtering Extendeds until now.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:15.280
You don't even know the trigger
points for regular humans, do you?

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:21.980
You already know that you'll
lose if I close in on you.

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:26.610
But you only took your shots when I got close.

00:03:26.610 --> 00:03:31.400
In other words, you should be low on needles.

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:34.280
I'm finally getting results.

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:39.610
That's why I can't let you
catch me in a place like this.

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:45.980
Do you really have the time to
play around with me, Kronen?

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:18.190
Was that Inui just now?

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:25.400
I have to save Juzo.

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:28.780
Save him? That guy?!

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:31.070
That's right...

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:37.070
Kunugi. I let the bastard escape.

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:56.530
He's me.

00:04:58.280 --> 00:05:06.400
The me that was just a tool that didn't
know the meaning of my choices.

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:08.190
That's why...

00:05:10.690 --> 00:05:14.650
I'm going to abandon this mission.

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:18.780
A soldier shouldn't kill his own comrades.

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:27.150
You're not my tool... much less
the tool of the command center.

00:05:27.150 --> 00:05:32.190
You decide what you want to do, Juzo.

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:36.730
I'm just a gun.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:44.320
I only exist to follow orders
and take down enemies.

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:51.860
I see.

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:59.230
Well, I guess that's your choice, partner.

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:10.900
That's why I can't lose against him.

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:15.230
Protective smokescreen dispersed.

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:23.280
Vertebral coupling bay. TH05 changed to 07.

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:26.070
Converting configuration to subjugation mode.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:31.030
I hate you.

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:34.730
Pepper only needs me.

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:38.320
But if Pepper really wants you...

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:42.940
...I'll defeat you and make
you bow down to Pepper,

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:45.900
even if it means destroying an entire city!

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:02.570
This is...

00:07:02.570 --> 00:07:06.360
We are currently at the End of War
Commemoration Park.

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:12.070
It seems the stadium is being heavily
damaged from a renegade Over-Extended.

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:15.900
Hey, now. Do you think
that it could be Juzo?

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:18.940
Please evacuate immediately if you are
near the park or neighborhood. I repeat...

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:18.940
Juzo...

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:37.110
In order to respond to any
situation of the war independently,

00:07:37.110 --> 00:07:43.780
structurally compressed vertebral coupling bays
known as the Devil's Backbone were installed.

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:50.070
The control device and key
to those bays are Hands.

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:52.860
You and Seven.

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:56.280
This is the difference between a
Gun Slave Unit with and without a shooter.

00:07:57.860 --> 00:08:03.570
I feel like you and I can complete one another.

00:08:05.570 --> 00:08:10.530
So become mine, Juzo.

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:25.940
You decide what you want to do, Juzo.

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:42.150
What the hell's wrong with you?!

00:08:42.150 --> 00:08:45.530
What are you trying to protect, to go this far?!

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:48.900
You're definitely going to die at this rate!

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:52.900
You should toss aside
intangible things like policies!

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:54.980
Even if you end up showing
your disgraceful side!

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:57.610
Not wanting to die is what it means to be human!

00:08:59.690 --> 00:09:02.480
I don't have anything like that!

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:07.190
I don't have anything that I'd
give up my own life to protect.

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:12.480
If I open you up...

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:16.860
...will I get my hands on something like that?

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:31.980
The results aren't very satisfactory
on an irregular like him.

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:37.190
If you're going to do it, hurry up.

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:47.820
The reason Harmony is special is because
it can hack into the sub-brain.

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:54.780
The hacking abilities of Harmony is needed
to remove that limiter so Device 13

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:59.820
can fight evenly against Seven.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:02.780
If I use Harmony...

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:06.690
Don't you ever think of using
Harmony on me again!

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:09.440
I'm sure Juzo will be mad.

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:17.400
What's important is what you'll
choose once you find out.

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:22.400
You obtained a chance to make a choice.

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:26.820
You get to decide your own worth.

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:31.110
Even so, I...

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:40.900
I want to save Juzo!

00:10:45.230 --> 00:10:50.030
This... This must be the reason
Berühren is chasing him down!

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:13.610
This is...

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:19.730
That's my trigger.

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:25.400
The trigger that the higher ups
and <i>that</i> guy used to always pull.

00:11:33.070 --> 00:11:37.230
I don't have any memories of
when I was still flesh and blood.

00:11:37.230 --> 00:11:43.070
The only me that I know is me as
a soldier through and through.

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:45.070
This is...

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:50.480
You're using something that
looks so unstylish again.

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:57.980
I heard that there are various daily goods
with sedatives mixed in for Extendeds now.

00:11:57.980 --> 00:12:01.570
Like cigarettes, for example.

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:04.780
These were distributed by the military.

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:07.360
It's not like I chose what to use.

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:13.480
You never change.

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:20.440
You know what our mission is this time.

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:24.730
We are supposed to eliminate Five and
ten other Gun Slave Units as well as

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:30.610
three Hands that are going
against the disposal order.

00:12:30.610 --> 00:12:37.070
Our targets have barricaded themselves
inside the church in the town of Tabal.

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:42.820
The small town is surrounded by soldiers,

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:46.940
but they won't engage in combat.

00:12:46.940 --> 00:12:52.860
You're the only one who will fight
against the targets, Juzo.

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:59.360
Your battle program will be active for 48 hours.

00:13:01.110 --> 00:13:03.280
Take care of everything in that time.

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:11.190
This'll be the last time I pull this trigger.

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:18.980
But don't forget, I'm always behind you.

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:24.980
Do you really understand what will
happen if you abandon this mission?

00:13:30.230 --> 00:13:33.360
Listen, partner.

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:37.230
That's what makes it such a stylish move.

00:13:53.780 --> 00:13:56.230
Juzo's memories?

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:12.070
That's why I didn't know how to
be anything other than a soldier.

00:14:16.730 --> 00:14:19.400
I thought you'd come soon.

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:25.820
Now don't be so hasty, Device 13.

00:14:27.230 --> 00:14:30.570
I'm tha only one here.

00:14:32.070 --> 00:14:38.480
I'm device 12. I go by Twelve.

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:42.570
I was thinkin' of talking with you.

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:55.190
The last Hands that was helpin'
us just took his last breath.

00:14:55.190 --> 00:15:00.650
Four Gun Slave Units have already fallen, too.

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:06.980
Our leader, Five, can't move
half of his body anymore.

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:16.030
Without a Hands, we can't even patch
ourselves up with the Devil's Backbone.

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:19.110
Everyone's beat up now.

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:23.570
We don't got the strength to
break through the soldiers.

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:27.860
We're soldiers at heart.

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:31.690
We ain't afraid of dying.

00:15:31.690 --> 00:15:37.360
It's just... we finally made
it through that war.

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:42.150
It doesn't hurt to enjoy life a little.

00:15:51.440 --> 00:15:56.650
Why don't you come with us, Device 13?

00:15:56.650 --> 00:16:00.190
We're all numbered comrades.

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:04.030
On top of that, no one else has faces like ours.

00:16:04.030 --> 00:16:07.110
We could even call ourselves brothers.

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:13.780
I'm... different from all of you.

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:21.440
I heard you got a different
setting from the rest of us.

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:26.360
That's probably why they sent
a guy like you to deal with us.

00:16:27.940 --> 00:16:30.360
Ya know, though...

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:35.610
That's even more of a reason
that you gotta make a decision.

00:16:36.860 --> 00:16:39.360
How you'll live.

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:41.440
That decision.

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:46.610
When your life comes to an end,
it'll be how you measure your worth.

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:51.780
Come with us, Device 13!

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:01.150
This is the last of the sedatives.

00:17:03.610 --> 00:17:10.030
Can't be helped if you want
to be a tool until the very end.

00:17:10.030 --> 00:17:14.940
But you know I can't let you go to my comrades.

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:22.230
Regenguss Faust.

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:29.190
I, Twelve, will take your life faster
than the speed of lightning!

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:36.030
Southwest of the town.

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:38.730
There's an underground transportation
route left by construction.

00:17:42.230 --> 00:17:45.860
The military doesn't know it exists.

00:17:52.690 --> 00:17:56.150
You're telling me there's a way out?

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:12.980
Come on, we're almost there.

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:18.690
Just a bit further everyone.

00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:20.780
But, really...

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:23.780
Is that guy trustworthy?

00:18:23.780 --> 00:18:29.190
It won't be funny if we're surrounded
the second we step outside.

00:18:29.190 --> 00:18:31.650
No worries, Five.

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:38.530
The moment we make it outta here will
be the moment of our birth as humans.

00:18:38.530 --> 00:18:40.530
We're gonna be kids with bodies like these?!

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:43.440
The stronger the baby, the better!

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:58.980
We really made it out...

00:18:58.980 --> 00:19:02.480
Looks like it's time for us to say, "Babuu."

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:06.150
What do you plan to do now?

00:19:06.150 --> 00:19:08.650
Well, our faces stand out a lot.

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:12.730
We'll have to lay low for a while.

00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:17.190
What? Time'll take care of everything.

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:23.530
I just wish that shackled man...

00:19:23.530 --> 00:19:27.030
...has a peaceful end.

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:38.480
I see, that's you're answer, huh?

00:19:57.780 --> 00:20:00.190
Confirming elimination of targets.

00:20:00.190 --> 00:20:03.230
Terminating battle mode.

00:20:03.230 --> 00:20:06.150
Looks like he baited them so
he could get them all at once.

00:20:06.150 --> 00:20:10.570
Even though they're comrades...
I can't believe it.

00:20:10.570 --> 00:20:15.190
He's just like he looks, a lunatic Extended.

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:32.320
We're all numbered comrades.

00:20:32.320 --> 00:20:35.980
We could even call ourselves brothers.

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:43.440
Shutdown of Device 5 confirmed.

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:46.400
Heavily damaged devices 2
and 9 have been collected.

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:49.150
Roger. Mission accomplished.

00:20:49.150 --> 00:20:50.860
Time to fall back.

00:20:50.860 --> 00:20:52.280
What are you doing? Hurry up.

00:20:52.280 --> 00:20:57.730
Don't forget, I'm always behind you.

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:04.730
I'm... I...

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:07.940
Well, I guess that's your choice.

00:21:07.940 --> 00:21:09.940
You're wrong.

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:13.860
Are you still being loyal to the
one who abandoned you?

00:21:13.860 --> 00:21:16.320
That ain't it.

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:19.570
That was the moment I
realized it for the first time.

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:26.530
The fact that I never made a decision until now.

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:31.900
I pushed all the decision making onto <i>him</i> ...

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:37.530
And, no matter who was pulling the trigger,

00:21:37.530 --> 00:21:41.480
everything that seemed like
the doings of someone else...

00:21:44.730 --> 00:21:49.730
...was actually all done by me!

00:23:27.480 --> 00:23:30.190
Why have things come to this?!

00:23:28.650 --> 00:23:31.230
Are they planning on startin' another war?

00:23:30.190 --> 00:23:32.780
Is this the orders of your owners?

00:23:31.230 --> 00:23:35.030
There's no way to save him anymore.

00:23:32.780 --> 00:23:35.030
It's my turn now, Juzo.

00:23:35.030 --> 00:23:41.860
<i>NO GUNS LIFE</i> . Episode 23.
"Trigger Again."
